            "label": "The Whole Food Matrix",
            "label_color": "teal",
            "name": "Greens, Reds & Berries",
            "source": "1.28g Organic Greens Blend · 875mg Organic Fruits & Berries Blend",
            "body": "<p>The real-food matrix. Organic carrot, green cabbage, broccoli, beet, chlorella, and spinach — alongside blueberry, apple, strawberry, sea buckthorn, acai, acerola cherry, and plum. Plus 710mg of antioxidant phytonutrients from organic green tea, goji berry, astragalus, and ginger. Not token amounts. A concentrated whole-food blend built for density.</p>",
            "nick": ""
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "featured": false,
            "icon": "<svg viewbox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></circle><circle cx=\"38\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></circle><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"10\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></circle><path d=\"M14,28 C14,28 18,40 30,44 C42,40 46,28 46,28\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "The Differentiator",
            "label": "The Nrf2 Activator",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "TrueBroc® Glucoraphanin",
            "source": "Brassica oleracea italica (seed) · 5 mg, standardized",
            "body": "<p>Standardized broccoli seed extract — the ingredient that sets this formula apart. TrueBroc® delivers measurable glucoraphanin, the stable precursor to sulforaphane. Sulforaphane activates the Nrf2 pathway, your body's master switch for antioxidant defense and cellular detoxification. Most greens powders include token broccoli powder. We use the standardized, trademarked extract backed by Brassica Protection Products LLC.</p>",
            "nick": ""
          }
        },
        "i3": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "featured": false,
            "icon": "<svg viewbox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M10,30 C10,20 18,14 26,18 C34,22 34,38 42,42 C50,46 54,38 54,30\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M6,38 C6,28 14,22 22,26 C30,30 30,46 38,50 C44,52 50,46 52,40\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"></path><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"30\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#6B7280\"></circle><circle cx=\"54\" cy=\"30\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#6B7280\"></circle></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "",
            "label": "The Gut Engine",
            "label_color": "mid",
            "name": "Digestive Support Blend",
            "source": "Probiotics + Enzymes · 20 mg",
            "body": "<p>Four probiotic strains and six digestive enzymes — working together. <em>L. acidophilus, B. longum, L. casei,</em> and <em>L. rhamnosus</em> support microbiome balance. Protease, amylase, bromelain, cellulase, lactase, and lipase complete the breakdown of proteins, starches, fiber, and fats. Because absorption matters as much as what's in the scoop. And 4.275g of organic prebiotic fiber — gum acacia, inulin, and flaxseed — feeds the probiotics you're adding.</p>",
            "nick": ""
          }
        }
